08 SPACE(n^2)\nProof: Write u \u2192 v if there's a ladder from u to v of length \u2264 b.\nHere's a recursive procedure to solve the bounded DFA ladder problem:"]}, "id": "lOBzFC_kyR", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.190559440559443, "y": 30.90909090909092, "width": 70.33260489510491, "height": 44.33566433566421, "rotation": 0}, "id": "zhaqUGT0-W", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.190559440559443, "y": 30.90909090909092, "width": 70.33260489510491, "height": 44.33566433566421, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "zhaqUGT0-W", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.190559440559443, "y": 30.90909090909092, "width": 70.33260489510491, "height": 44.33566433566421, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDERDFA = {(B, u, v, b)| B a DFA and u \u2192 v by a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB-L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u b/2 \u2192 w and w b/2 \u2192 v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDERDFA with B-L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "zhaqUGT0-W", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 1.8776223776223777, "y": 75.24475524475524, "width": 14.238636363636365, "height": 5.31468531468532, "rotation": 0}, "id": "xI9MXFXDgz", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "re